<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">

  <PropertyGroup>
    <TargetFramework>netstandard2.0</TargetFramework>
    <RootNamespace>Nova</RootNamespace>
    <AssemblyName>Nova</AssemblyName>
    <Platforms>AnyCPU;x64</Platforms>
    <Deterministic>true</Deterministic>
    <GeneratePackageOnBuild>False</GeneratePackageOnBuild>
    <GenerateDocumentationFile>true</GenerateDocumentationFile>
    <Title>Nova core library for mass spectrometry data management.</Title>
    <Authors>Michael Hoopmann, Devin Schweppe</Authors>
    <Company>University of Washington, Schweppe Lab</Company>
    <PackageId>Nova</PackageId>
    <Description>Mass spectrometry spectral data model and interprocess communication (named pipes).</Description>
    <Copyright>Copyright 2025-2026</Copyright>
    <PackageProjectUrl>https://github.com/SchweppeLab/Nova</PackageProjectUrl>
    <RepositoryUrl>https://github.com/SchweppeLab/Nova</RepositoryUrl>
    <RepositoryType>git</RepositoryType>
    <PackageTags>mass spectrometry;spectrum</PackageTags>
    <PackageLicenseExpression>Apache-2.0</PackageLicenseExpression>
    <PackageReadmeFile>README.md</PackageReadmeFile>
    <PackageReleaseNotes>
1.1.0 - first release since 1.0.0.18.

BREAKING
* Retargeted from .NET Framework 4.8 to netstandard2.0; one build now serves
  net48 and net8.0+ consumers.
* IPC wire format changed: Spectrum serialization now includes ScanDescription.
  1.1.0 cannot talk to 1.0.0.18 over a pipe - upgrade both ends together.
* FramentationType and PrecursorIon.FramentationMethod renamed to
  FragmentationType and FragmentationMethod. Recompile.

NEW
* ISpectrum carries ScanDescription.
* IChromatogram and IChromatDataPoint are now public.

FIXED
* PipeIO.Read handles partial stream reads; larger messages could be truncated.
* Deserialize appended precursors to those already on the spectrum instead of
  replacing them.
* PrecursorIon's copy constructor and Clear skipped CollisionEnergy,
  FragmentationMethod, and IsolationSpecificity.

https://github.com/SchweppeLab/Nova
    </PackageReleaseNotes>
    <Version>1.1.0</Version>
    <AssemblyVersion>1.1.0.0</AssemblyVersion>
    <FileVersion>1.1.0.0</FileVersion>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <None Include="..\README.md" Pack="true" PackagePath="\" />
  </ItemGroup>

</Project>
